{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029095011473-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029095612\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（29日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘、石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘、廈門灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該6處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該6處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:00:47.210042+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:50:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T03:58:33.285993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:58:27.465978+00:00","content_hash":"cbd650c9f41e645cdb31977a1ba179b38bbbbaa246cca05bb1bc54d5ca16fa98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}